# Minimal game-action example. Walk stands in for a future attack clip.
initial idle
param speed 0
param dead 0
trigger attack
state idle clip idle loop speed 1
state walk clip walk loop speed 1 rate speed 0.25 0.3 1.5
state action clip walk once speed 1
event action 0.1 hit
state die clip die once speed 1
transition * die priority 100 after 0 when dead > 0
transition idle action priority 50 after 0 when attack > 0
transition walk action priority 50 after 0 when attack > 0
transition action walk priority 0 after 0 when finished > 0 & speed > 0.4
transition action idle priority 0 after 0 when finished > 0 & speed <= 0.4
transition idle walk priority 0 after 0 when speed > 0.4
transition walk idle priority 0 after 0 when speed <= 0.4
